  "newCodeRationale": "Reuse PolicyChecks, CanonicalDocuments/SpanAssembler, exact TextLocator/LocatorConversion, PdoUsages resource/ancestor plans and PdoCatalogTransaction. Donors lack the approved PHP byte-coordinate and unit disclosure contracts. Owner Q1=a authorizes a distinct UnitDisclosure and reference-only revision/unit Usage with confirmed COMMIT and metadata-only replay.",
  "sourceGaps": [
    "Donor character maps and first-hit/fuzzy evidence keys cannot be reused as canonical byte identity; no source code was copied.",
    "Donors do not provide tenant-qualified revision/unit Usage, authoritative SQL shared guards, DB-clock freshness, atomic outbox or ambiguous-COMMIT handling. These reuse core primitives with migration 010.",
    "Optional unicode-nfd-intl-v1 is implemented by an explicit ICU adapter; whitespace baseline never canonical-normalizes. No optional external storage/worker adapter is claimed qualified by a contract double."
  ]
